  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dalit Human Rights Defenders Network: Making Regulation Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To secure implementation in India of UN Draft Principles and Guidelines for the Effective Elimination of Discrimination based on Work and DescentSpecific objectives: To create an efficient network of leading Dalit Human Rights Defenders (HRD) to fight against the ineffectiveness of action against rights abuses and to ensure that anti-discrimination mechanisms are properly and thoroughly implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
